      "date": "2026-02-17T11:39:18.000Z",
      "title": "Third quarter 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹61.04 (vs ₹5.60 in 3Q 2025)",
      "body": "Third quarter 2026 results: EPS: ₹61.04 (up from ₹5.60 in 3Q 2025). Revenue: ₹478.1m (up 78% from 3Q 2025). Net income: ₹70.9m (up ₹64.4m from 3Q 2025). Profit margin: 15% (up from 2.4% in 3Q 2025). The increase in margin was driven by higher revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has increased by 55% per year but the company’s share price has only increased by 6% per year, which means it is significantly lagging earnings growth.",
